    rdfs:label "Regulatory Investigation" ; skos:prefLabel "Regulatory Investigation" ;
    skos:definition "A regulatory investigation is a formal inquiry conducted by a governmental or regulatory agency to examine whether laws, regulations, or industry standards have been violated. It aims to ensure compliance, enforce rules, and protect public interests in various sectors such as finance, healthcare, and environmental protection." ;
